(7412467, 1168199, 97225, '<td valign="top">It sucks! (the DQ of course). Great entry and all the more of a credit to you because you are convalescing and somewhat limited in what you can do. Best wishes - hope you are completely well again soon.</td>', 'It sucks! (the DQ of course). Great entry and all the more of a credit to you because you are convalescing and somewhat limited in what you can do. Best wishes - hope you are completely well again soon.', '2015-10-27 01:31:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7412469, 1168199, 32108, '<td valign="top">This was one of my top two picks so I am very sorry for your DQ, I hope you sort out your workflow for the future. On a separate note what happened to the comment I left during voting? Did you see it or did I click the wrong button after entering it?</td>', 'This was one of my top two picks so I am very sorry for your DQ, I hope you sort out your workflow for the future. On a separate note what happened to the comment I left during voting? Did you see it or did I click the wrong button after entering it?', '2015-10-27 01:40:23.000000', NULL, 0),
